state 1

  210 symbol: SYMBOL .

    $default  reduce using rule 210 (symbol)


state 2

  218 regex: REGEX .
  219      | REGEX . REGOPT

    REGOPT  shift, and go to state 66

    $default  reduce using rule 218 (regex)


